  triage:closureNote "quality-mgr: verified against integrate/phase-AI head (efe73e1c) -- dedicated test ai11_deletion_gate_detector_rejects_retired_envelope_wire_codec_ast_fixtures() exists at line 1255 with AST fixtures validating rejection of FrameHeader, FrameCodec, read_framed_request, write_framed_response constructs. Defect closed. Stale occurrence from superseded branch feature/pAI-s11-post-merge-remediation; closing to match reality. (2026-07-26)" ;
